# Handoff documents awaiting a publication decision
#
# V2_HANDOFF_PRD.md is deliberately untracked pending Randi's decision on
# whether it is published. On 2026-08-16 a `git add -A docs/` swept it into a
# commit and pushed it to this public repository. The branch was deleted within
# minutes, but an orphaned commit in a public repository stays retrievable by
# SHA, so the exposure is permanent and is recorded in docs/release-audit.md.
#
# Deliberate intent is not a mechanism. This line is the mechanism. Remove it
# only as an explicit decision to publish the file.
docs/handoff/V2_HANDOFF_PRD.md
